profile_short_name:Eth_N_Chel2_SmoothV3_AntiCrash
profile_designer:Stijn Dings
profile_description:Smoothed v3 AntiCrash — conservative 50 g version. Same roast-temperature curve and PID as v2; fan adjusted for stronger early bean movement and a flatter first-crack transition to reduce airflow-induced RoR crash/flick risk.Targets:- Start: 30°C- CC: 3:49 @ 155°C- FC: 7:15 @ 204°C- Drop: 8:00 @ 209°C- RoR decline interval: 3:30–7:00- Use only after Fan Preview confirms continuous bean circulation.
